# Local environment overrides. `.env` may contain real, overridden secrets
# (database password, JWT signing secret, LocalStack PRO token) and MUST NOT be
# committed (AAP 0.8.1 — no hardcoded real credentials). The documented template
# `.env.example` is intentionally tracked and is therefore allowlisted below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Maven build output — generated by `mvn`/`./mvnw` (compiled classes, test
# reports, the packaged jar, JaCoCo/OWASP reports). Never committed.
target/

# OWASP dependency-check NVD database cache. Pinned to a stable, clean-surviving
# directory (see pom.xml dependency-check.data.directory) so the multi-hundred-MB
# NVD feed is downloaded once and reused; it is regenerated on demand and MUST NOT
# be committed.
.dependency-check-data/
